name=HARMONIE - Life With Style
id=HARMONIE_LifeWithStyle
description=A wardrobe for the server's fashion. Fashion pieces never spawn in the world: admins give them. They belong to the player's account, not the character -- they never drop, can not be stolen, and stay after death. Wear them in 18 fashion slots of their own (hat, mask, glasses, ears, neck, top, outerwear, full outfit, bottoms, gloves, shoes, wrists, rings, waist, back, make-up, tail, special); while a piece is worn, the real clothes of that slot are hidden (they still protect and keep you warm), or shown under it if you like. Players can trade pieces with each other (both agree, the server swaps them; sandbox: on/off, distance). Pets: a dog (5 breeds) or a cat (11 coats) in the wardrobe's Pet box comes out and follows its owner -- right-click it to Pet, Feed, give Orders (Follow, Stay, Come here, Make a sound) or Put it away; it never attacks and nothing hurts it (sandbox: pets, orders, feeding, hunger on/off). The pets' models, textures, animations and voices are from Companion Dogs and its CD: Cats add-on, used with the author's permission (CREDITS_PETS.txt). Only Life With Style's own pieces ever go in the wardrobe -- never items of other mods. Gacha items (the RWZ Retention Items: medical items, capsules, manuals, field guides, survival journeys, the New Dawn set) are given by admins too, never go in the inventory and are used from their own tab, with search and category filters; the buffs show on the right of the screen. White wardrobe window with a collection (search and filters, or the whole fashion catalog), trading, an admin page and a guide. English and Thai.
